cff-version: "1.2.0"
message: "If you use this software, please cite it using the metadata below."
type: software
title: "GenealogyKG: Genealogical Knowledge Graph"
abstract: >
  GenealogyKG is a KGModule that builds a semantic knowledge graph from GEDCOM
  family-history files. It indexes people, families, events, places and
  sources with their lineage relationships, enabling natural-language search,
  ancestor and descendant walks, time-scoped federated queries, and MCP-based
  AI integration over genealogical data.
